{"version":"r3177","asset_base_url":"https://pub-c0dceaa4fc5b48d1811c48f6f91a899c.r2.dev","id":"A0163","langs":[{"lang":"1001","name":"中文-普通话","cv":"郑好","lines":[{"skin":"A0163001","type":"dropLine","order":1,"label":"招集","text":"我是三兔莲花飞天藻井，叫我三兔藻井就好。我来自敦煌，是传统建筑中天花板的独特装饰，可别把我与其他装饰弄混了。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_dropLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"regardsLine","order":2,"label":"问候","text":"昨天处理了突发的火灾事故，看了中西壁画交流的规划书，还规划了团建的事情……我是器者，一晚上不睡没事的。倒是你，别忙得忘了休息。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_regardsLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"appointmentLine","order":3,"label":"任命","text":"放心，我在敦煌的时候就经常协助莫高窟记，会帮你处理好眼下的事。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_appointmentLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"touchLine_1","order":4,"label":"交谈1","text":"藻井不是井，它是覆斗形建筑的窟顶装饰，古代的宫殿和寺庙里都少不了它的身影。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_touchLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"touchLine_2","order":5,"label":"交谈2","text":"这里的温度和湿度正好合适，看来你也是一位有讲究的人。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_touchLine_2.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"touchLine_3","order":6,"label":"交谈3","text":"现在的人类，就算看到我的耳朵，也不会感觉奇怪。兔耳朵形状的装饰……很常见吧？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_touchLine_3.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"touchLine_4","order":7,"label":"投契之谈","text":"起甲病害回贴、空鼓病害灌浆、酥碱病害脱盐加固技术，有想了解的吗？这些都是很有用的壁画保护技术，也许你以后有机会用到？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_touchLine_4.mp3","unlock":"感应达到投契解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"touchLine_5","order":8,"label":"鹿鸣之谈","text":"那日我见研究没有进展，便去和两位研究员说了点有利于竞争的话。这两人的好胜心被激起来，自然是谁也不让谁，很快便有突破。我得到趣事，他们得到研究成果，何乐而不为？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_touchLine_5.mp3","unlock":"感应达到鹿鸣解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"touchLine_6","order":9,"label":"莫逆之谈","text":"监测设备能让人们随时知道窟内的温度与相对湿度，甚至还能显示出外部的噪音和风沙。幸好有这些不断发展的技术，身处敦煌的我们才能更长久地停留世间。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_touchLine_6.mp3","unlock":"感应达到莫逆解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"timeLine_1","order":10,"label":"时段交谈1","text":"player，早上好！我？当然要去窟里啦，可不能让莫高窟记等久了。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_timeLine_1.mp3","zone":"6:00–18:00"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"timeLine_2","order":11,"label":"时段交谈2","text":"天干物燥，小心火烛。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_timeLine_2.mp3","zone":"18:00–23:59"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"unuseLine","order":12,"label":"独处","text":"我听人说，你的前辈曾与商鞅方升在办公室大打出手，直接劈了他的桌子。他们怎么不多闹点动静？这样我们就能看见——那张波澜不惊的脸上少有地出现有趣的表情。你可别和那位总监说，这话是我说的。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_unuseLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"levelUpLine","order":13,"label":"升级","text":"还是需要些与飞上天空有关的资料……","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_levelUpLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"joinpLine","order":14,"label":"加入编队","text":"需要我来灭火？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_joinpLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"strengthenLine_1","order":15,"label":"致知提升","text":"壁画上的赤色，时间一长就会变成黑色，我也就从赤兔变成了“黑兔”。无论赤兔还是黑兔，那都是我，这一点从来不会改变。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_strengthenLine_1.mp3","unlock":"知行合一解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"strengthenLine_2","order":16,"label":"焕彰","text":"赤兔和白兔都是祥瑞的象征，不过赤兔更稀有，这是不是意味着我能给大家带来更多的好运？在好运的加持下，火灾会更少吧？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_strengthenLine_2.mp3","unlock":"焕彰·感闻解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"strengthenLine_3","order":17,"label":"精研","text":"就算是祥瑞，也无法阻止从赤色到黑色的过程，无论什么颜色，最后都会消失，不过在彻底消失前，也要好好地向人展示出颜色本身的价值，不是吗？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_strengthenLine_3.mp3","unlock":"精研解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"equipLine_1","order":18,"label":"装备穿戴1","text":"它会带来幸运？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_equipLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"equipLine_2","order":19,"label":"装备穿戴2","text":"它能让我飞得更高？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_equipLine_2.mp3","unlock":"感应达到投契解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"displayLine_1","order":20,"label":"战斗登场1","text":"有新的热闹可看？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_displayLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"displayLine_2","order":21,"label":"战斗登场2","text":"救火大师三兔藻井已到。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_displayLine_2.mp3","unlock":"感应达到推心解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"switchToLine","order":22,"label":"聚焦","text":"小事，交给我。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_switchToLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"switchToLine_2","order":23,"label":"聚焦2","text":"给他们点教训。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_switchToLine_2.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"switchToLine_3","order":24,"label":"聚焦3","text":"月相显现！","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_switchToLine_3.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"skillLine","order":25,"label":"释放技能","text":"以水克火！","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_skillLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"skillLine_2","order":26,"label":"释放技能2","text":"祥瑞御水！","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_skillLine_2.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"beDyingLine","order":27,"label":"濒危","text":"火势还在蔓延……","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_beDyingLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"skillReadyLine","order":28,"label":"绝技就绪","text":"月中有兔！","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_skillReadyLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"skillReadyLine_2","order":29,"label":"绝技就绪2","text":"三兔共耳!","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_skillReadyLine_2.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"victoryLine_1","order":30,"label":"破局成功1","text":"“三”是无限的意思，无限的祥瑞当然为你带来胜利。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_victoryLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"victoryLine_2","order":31,"label":"破局成功2","text":"任务完成，下一个灭火地点在哪里？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_victoryLine_2.mp3","unlock":"感应达到推心解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"loseLine_1","order":32,"label":"破局失败1","text":"曲解造成的火势，也不是那么好灭的。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_loseLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"loseLine_2","order":33,"label":"破局失败2","text":"火势过大，请求支援！","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_loseLine_2.mp3","unlock":"感应达到推心解锁"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"enterInstallationLine","order":34,"label":"入驻","text":"若能在此加一幅壁画就好了。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_enterInstallationLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"installationLine_1","order":35,"label":"设施会话1","text":"先把规划书看完。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_installationLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"installationLine_2","order":36,"label":"设施会话2","text":"你刚才……没有摸到我的耳朵对吧？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_installationLine_2.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"expeditionsucceedLine","order":37,"label":"远征成功","text":"途中遇到了一点小麻烦，不过用小麻烦换更多的战利品也是一种幸运。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_expeditionsucceedLine.mp3","unlock":"功能模块开发中"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"expeditionstartLine","order":38,"label":"远征出发","text":"希望这次战斗中能有新的发现，比如保存特殊物件的方法……","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_expeditionstartLine.mp3","unlock":"功能模块开发中"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"expeditionbackLine","order":39,"label":"远征归来","text":"不少好东西，看看？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_expeditionbackLine.mp3","unlock":"功能模块开发中"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"giftVictoryLine","order":40,"label":"感应1","text":"谢谢player！这些资料里居然有如此可靠的构想，我需要和莫高窟记讨论一下……","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_giftVictoryLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"giftLoseLine","order":41,"label":"感应2","text":"这些资料我给莫高窟记就行，确认过没问题了。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_giftLoseLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"teaVictoryLine","order":42,"label":"品茗1","text":"有种淡淡的清香，是我喜欢的味道。能在疲惫的时候喝上一杯茶，还不错。","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_teaVictoryLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"teaLoseLine","order":43,"label":"品茗2","text":"那些兽型器者或许更喜欢这种茶的味道，让我带给它们……","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_teaLoseLine.mp3"},{"skin":"A0163001","type":"happyBirthdayLine","order":44,"label":"生日庆贺","text":"player生日快乐！为了庆祝这个重要的日子，我特意去找了一些好东西送给你——有土红、朱砂、青金石、石青……你想创作壁画的时候就可以用到！嗯？为什么不直接送颜料？创作壁画当然要从处理原材料开始啦，这样才更有意义不是吗？","key":"voice/a0163/1001/a0163001_happyBirthdayLine.mp3"},{"skin":"V0163001","type":"dropLine","order":1,"label":"招集","text":"","key":"voice/a0163/1001/v0163001_dropLine.mp3"},{"skin":"V0163001","type":"regardsLine","order":2,"label":"问候","text":"","key":"voice/a0163/1001/v0163001_regardsLine.mp3"},{"skin":"V0163001","type":"appointmentLine","order":3,"label":"任命","text":"","key":"voice/a0163/1001/v0163001_appointmentLine.mp3"},{"skin":"V0163001","type":"touchLine_1","order":4,"label":"交谈1","text":"","key":"voice/a0163/1001/v0163001_touchLine_1.mp3"},{"skin":"V0163001","type":"